## Pricing model characteristics (structure only, no figures)
- Annual subscription per organisation (tenant)
- Inclusive of support, updates, hosting
- Standard/Enterprise tiers consistent across all products
- No per-user or per-call metering
- No hidden fees; setup, migration, training quoted separately on request
- Call-off contracts up to 60 months under G-Cloud 15

